{"text":"kuruntokai","n":330,"lines":["நலத்தகைப் புலைத்தி பசைதோய்த் தெடுத்துத்","தலைப்புடைப் போக்கித் தண்கயத் திட்ட","நீரிற் பிரியாப் பரூஉத்திரி கடுக்கும்","பேரிலைப் பகன்றைப் பொதியவிழ் வான்பூ","இன்கடுங் கள்ளின் மணமில கமழும்","புன்கண் மாலையும் புலம்பும்","இன்றுகொல் தோழியவர் சென்ற நாட்டே"],"tr":["nalattakaip pulaitti pacaitōyt teṭuttut","talaippuṭaip pōkkit taṇkayat tiṭṭa","nīriṟ piriyāp parūuttiri kaṭukkum","pērilaip pakaṉṟaip potiyaviḻ vāṉpū","iṉkaṭuṅ kaḷḷiṉ maṇamila kamaḻum","puṉkaṇ mālaiyum pulampum","iṉṟukol tōḻiyavar ceṉṟa nāṭṭē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கழார்க் கீரனெயிற்றியனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kaḻārk Kīraṉeyiṟṟiyaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"7 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"6×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 24, veṇcīr 2, vañcicīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 13, āciriyattaḷai 11, oṉṟiya vañcittaḷai 1, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"நலத்தகைப்","tr":"nalattakaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நலத்","tr":"nalat"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தகைப்","tr":"takaip"}]},{"text":"புலைத்தி","tr":"pulaitti","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புலைத்","tr":"pulait"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தி","tr":"ti"}]},{"text":"பசைதோய்த்","tr":"pacaitōyt","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசை","tr":"pacai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோய்த்","tr":"tōyt"}]},{"text":"தெடுத்துத்","tr":"teṭuttut","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தெடுத்","tr":"teṭut"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"துத்","tr":"tut"}]}],[{"text":"தலைப்புடைப்","tr":"talaippuṭaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலைப்","tr":"talaip"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புடைப்","tr":"puṭaip"}]},{"text":"போக்கித்","tr":"pōkkit","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போக்","t